nal]], in the possession of [[Lok Lambert]]. Other [[Suits]] used several Raypulse spells against Sophie and Lok when they were attempting to flee the dormitory. Later, [[Unnamed Suit 003]] used the spell on the ground to threaten Sophie to come with the Organization for questioning. [[Mr. MacTavish]] also cast this spell against Lok just outside [[Dante Vale's house]], sending him to the ground. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\n[[Sophie Casterwill]] used Raypulse's reflective properties to rebound it off of a series of mirrors to open a passageway into the [[Paris Catacombs]]. {{Source|Crawling the Catacombs}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Unnamed Suit 001 used Raypulse against Sophie Casterwill inside Lok's dormitory when attempting to get Eathon Lambert's journal, in the possession of Lok Lambert. Other Suits used several Raypulse spells against Sophie and Lok when they were attempting to flee the dormitory. Later, Unnamed Suit 003 used the spell on the ground to threaten Sophie to come with the Organization for questioning. Mr. MacTavish also cast this spell against Lok just outside Dante Vale's house, sending him to the ground. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nSophie Casterwill used Raypulse's reflective properties to rebound it off of a series of mirrors to open a passageway into the Paris Catacombs. [Crawling the Catacombs]"},{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}\n* [[Billie]]\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Ford]]\n* [[Ford's Gang]]\n* [[Grier]]\n* [[Harrison Fears]]\n* [[Hippolyta]]\n* [[Klaus]]\n* [[LeBlanche]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n{{col-2}}\n* [[Ms. Thorpe]]\n* [[Rassimov]]\n* [[Ryder]]\n* [[Scarlet Byrne]]\n* [[Shauna]]\n* [[Silent Soldiers]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Stack]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[The Professor]]\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]\n{{col-end}}","text":"• Billie\n• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Ford\n• Ford's Gang\n• Grier\n• Harrison Fears\n• Hippolyta\n• Klaus\n• LeBlanche\n• Lok Lambert\n\n• Ms. Thorpe\n• Rassimov\n• Ryder\n• Scarlet Byrne\n• Shauna\n• Silent Soldiers\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Stack\n• Suits\n• The Professor\n• Zhalia Moon"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Pulso-rayon\n|POR=Raio-laser\", \"Raios-laser\", \"Raio-pulsor\", \"Rai-pulsor\", \"Raio-repulsor|DUT=Pulsstraal}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","text":"French: Pulso-rayon\nPortuguese: Raio-laser\", \"Raios-laser\", \"Raio-pulsor\", \"Rai-pulsor\", \"Raio-repulsor\nDutch: Pulsstraal"}],"full_text":"Raypulse is a basic spell that manifests as a bolt of electrical energy that can be fired from the hands of the caster. The nature of this spell permits it to rebound off of reflective surfaces.\n\nHistory\n\nUnnamed Suit 001 used Raypulse against Sophie Casterwill inside Lok's dormitory when attempting to get Eathon Lambert's journal, in the possession of Lok Lambert. Other Suits used several Raypulse spells against Sophie and Lok when they were attempting to flee the dormitory. Later, Unnamed Suit 003 used the spell on the ground to threaten Sophie to come with the Organization for questioning. Mr. MacTavish also cast this spell against Lok just outside Dante Vale's house, sending him to the ground. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nSophie Casterwill used Raypulse's reflective properties to rebound it off of a series of mirrors to open a passageway into the Paris Catacombs. [Crawling the Catacombs]\n\nUsers\n\n• Billie\n• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Ford\n• Ford's Gang\n• Grier\n• Harrison Fears\n• Hippolyta\n• Klaus\n• LeBlanche\n• Lok Lambert\n\n• Ms. Thorpe\n• Rassimov\n• Ryder\n• Scarlet Byrne\n• Shauna\n• Silent Soldiers\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Stack\n• Suits\n• The Professor\n• Zhalia Moon\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Pulso-rayon\nPortuguese: Raio-laser\", \"Raios-laser\", \"Raio-pulsor\", \"Rai-pulsor\", \"Raio-repulsor\nDutch: Pulsstraal","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E07 Raypulse.png\n| aura  = Orange\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Blood Spiral]] members <br> [[Hippolyta]] <br> [[Huntik Foundation]] members <br> [[The Organization|Organization]] members\n| first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n| frname = Pulso Rayon\n}}\n'''Raypulse''' is a basic spell that manifests as a bolt of electrical energy that can be fired from the hands of the caster. The nature of this spell permits it to rebound off of reflective surfaces.\n\n== History ==\n[[Unnamed Suit 001]] used Raypulse against [[Sophie Casterwill]] inside [[Lok's dormitory]] when attempting to get [[Eathon Lambert's journal]], in the possession of [[Lok Lambert]]. Other [[Suits]] used several Raypulse spells against Sophie and Lok when they were attempting to flee the dormitory. Later, [[Unnamed Suit 003]] used the spell on the ground to threaten Sophie to come with the Organization for questioning. [[Mr. MacTavish]] also cast this spell against Lok just outside [[Dante Vale's house]], sending him to the ground. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\n[[Sophie Casterwill]] used Raypulse's reflective properties to rebound it off of a series of mirrors to open a passageway into the [[Paris Catacombs]]. {{Source|Crawling the Catacombs}}\n\n{{clear}}\n== Users ==\n{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}\n* [[Billie]]\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Ford]]\n* [[Ford's Gang]]\n* [[Grier]]\n* [[Harrison Fears]]\n* [[Hippolyta]]\n* [[Klaus]]\n* [[LeBlanche]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n{{col-2}}\n* [[Ms. Thorpe]]\n* [[Rassimov]]\n* [[Ryder]]\n* [[Scarlet Byrne]]\n* [[Shauna]]\n* [[Silent Soldiers]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Stack]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[The Professor]]\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]\n{{col-end}}\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Pulso-rayon\n|POR=Raio-laser\", \"Raios-laser\", \"Raio-pulsor\", \"Rai-pulsor\", \"Raio-repulsor|DUT=Pulsstraal}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Casterwill family magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Orange-aura spells","Organization magic"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3288","status":"resolved","target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3497","status":"resolved","target_title":"Hippolyta","label":"Hippolyta","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hippolyta","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3497"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2257","status":"resolved","target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:17509","status":"resolved","target_title":"Unnamed Suit 001","label":"Unnamed Suit 001","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_001","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17509"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2041","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2661","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok's dormitory","label":"Lok's dormitory","target_url":"